[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035769177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4035769177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4035769177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wjPNZ","user":{"login":"Shadows-of-Fire","id":3682588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODI1ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3682588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire","html_url":"https://github.com/Shadows-of-Fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shadows-of-Fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T02:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T02:30:51Z","body":"Seems like a good change, given this conversion was being done in a bunch of scattered places already. One thing that isn't clear to me is why we have to do this conversion at all. Why are there two formats for code positions?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4035769177/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063436877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4063436877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4063436877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yMyBN","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T17:16:32Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T17:16:32Z","body":"> One thing that isn't clear to me is why we have to do this conversion at all. Why are there two formats for code positions?\r\n\r\nAs for the tab thing no clue :shrug: \r\n\r\nThe one-based vs zero-based might originally have been meant to have line numbers be in a readable format for error messages. You could obviously do a conversion for that. But by now the one-based stuff is to relied upon in different parts (the whole debugger stuff and stack trace stuff works one-based). So changing that aspect would just be a lot of noise without real benefit IMO","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063436877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081371053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4081371053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4081371053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zRMet","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T10:26:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T10:26:46Z","body":"Internally, we can use any option we find most convenient: tab-aware columns or raw offsets, 0- or 1-based indexing. However, I think that users should see \"natural\"  line and columns (tab-aware, 1-based indexing). This applies to the position indicator in the script editor, error/warning messages, etc. This option is the most common among text editors.\r\n\r\nPerhaps by losing tab-aware column information, we complicate their detection where they are needed? For example, this PR likely breaks cursor display (`^^^` and `vvv`) here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/734f5473c15d90b3edc452c08b4e43bebfefd1ce/modules/gdscript/tests/test_gdscript.cpp#L68-L104\r\n\r\nAn alternative, but more memory-intensive option is something like:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nstruct SourcePosition {\r\n    int position = 0;\r\n    int line = 1;\r\n    int column = 1; // Tab-aware.\r\n    int _raw_column = 0; // Raw offset.\r\n\r\n    _FORCE_INLINE_ int get_line_index() const { return line - 1; }\r\n    _FORCE_INLINE_ int get_column_index() const { return _raw_column; }\r\n};\r\n\r\nstruct SourceRegion {\r\n    SourcePosition start;\r\n    SourcePosition end;\r\n};\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081371053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081394045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4081394045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4081394045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zRSF9","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T10:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T10:30:51Z","body":"> However, I think that users should see \"natural\" line and columns (tab-aware, 1-based indexing). This applies to the position indicator in the script editor, error/warning messages, etc. This option is the most common among text editors.\r\n\r\nThat's a good point","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081394045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081471379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4081471379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4081471379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zRk-T","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T10:44:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T10:44:14Z","body":"> However, I think that users should see \"natural\" line and columns (tab-aware, 1-based indexing). This applies to the position indicator in the script editor, error/warning messages, etc. This option is the most common among text editors.\r\n\r\nI agree on that. And this PR adhers to that idea.\r\n\r\nI did not find error/warning messages that include columns. And the user is still shown human readable positions in the editor. However the conversion is moved to the editor/frontend code.\r\n\r\nBut you are right, I did miss the positioning display for this specific part you linked. I only checked the position indicators in the LSP test suite. But since the positions are in LSP format those were not influenced.\r\n\r\nAs for internal vs external. LSP uses the `ScriptLanguage` interface. So to benefit from this change the format used in that API has to be changed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4081471379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082402407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4082402407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4082402407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zVIRn","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T13:06:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T13:06:04Z","body":"> For example, this PR likely breaks cursor display (`^^^` and `vvv`) here:\r\n\r\nThis is addressed now.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> Perhaps by losing tab-aware column information, we complicate their detection where they are needed?\r\n\r\nI don't believe so. Most cases were a human readable position is needed don't actually lie within GDScript. So it makes sense to use a convenient format at the system boundaries.\r\nThe other parts of the engine already operate with non-readable internal positions, so I don't see any complications there.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082402407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124230100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4124230100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4124230100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc710sHU","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","u