"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124230100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4124757855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4124757855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4124757855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc712s9f","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T08:42:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T12:10:10Z","body":"> Did you change them to 0-based?\r\n\r\nNo, this PR only changes how columns are counted in regards to tabs. Positioning is still one-based in GDScript/`ScriptLanguage`, while other parts of the engine use zero based positions.\r\n\r\nEdit: Slight correction, some parts of the `ScriptLanguage` API also use zero based positions (`find_function`), it's kinda a mess.\r\n","