ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T09:03:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T09:03:32Z","body":"> I was under the impression, that binary tokenization does not encode column information.\r\n\r\nIt does. See here: https://github.com/HolonProduction/godot/blob/612475a680178afc6910687c616a054664ccc8f2/modules/gdscript/gdscript_tokenizer_buffer.cpp#L342\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4414901530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415009158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116986#issuecomment-4415009158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116986","id":4415009158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABByexhg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T10:01:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T10:01:11Z","body":"Ah fair, I guess I only checked `_token_to_binary`.\r\n\r\nAfter taking a closer look I'm still not convinced a version bump is needed. Columns seem to be exclusively used for indentation purposes, as long as they are consistent within the file everything should work fine.\r\n\r\nOr put differently, a tab indented script tokenized on a previous version will result in the same bytecode as a space indented script tokenized on a version containing this PR. So there should be no issues parsing those old files. Am I missing something?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4415009158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]